 For example, a CI build should probably never create a new the violation store, but operate on
 an existing one.
 
+With `default.integrity=repair`, the store can remove broken or resolved entries and move misplaced
+files, but `default.allowStoreUpdate=true` is required. With `default.integrity=fail`, initialization
+reports integrity problems without changing the store.
